# .prose-excludes — extra paths the "one paragraph per line" normalizer skips.
# The fleet's claude-run runner (the shared ai-runner kit, consumed by reference
# from bamr87/bamr87/.github/actions/claude-run@main) reads this file after every
# successful agent run before unwrapping the markdown the agent changed; one
# extended regex per line, matched against repo-relative paths. SCHEMA.md and
# CHANGELOG.md are always skipped. These two are machine-authored session
# reports from the quest-perfection loop, never hand-authored prose — keep them
# in lockstep with .github/workflows/markdown-oneline.yml and the Makefile.
(^|/)pages/_quest-reports/
(^|/)test/quest-validator/walkthroughs/
